      "evidence": "The interviewer repeatedly used the phrase 'आगे बढ़ने से पहले, क्या आप ऊपर दिए गए प्रश्न का उत्तर दे सकते हैं?' even when the patient had already provided the answer or was clearly engaged, making the interaction feel robotic."
